September-27-2026.html#thm:main","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:9dd10892522e2134d7f50775f02f50ba8a3bad6952c5bac75204fbbd662c016d","file":"preprints/Asymptotic-midpoint-uniform-convexity-and-unbounded-diamond-distortion-in-a-reflexive-tree-space-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":99,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"6a26560136ac9465c1c1bea9bd8bfd5645a67125dfe082a7d1b48f62726e9a7c","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Asymptotic-midpoint-uniform-convexity-and-unbounded-diamond-distortion-in-a-reflexive-tree-space-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:9dd10892522e2134d7f50775f02f50ba8a3bad6952c5bac75204fbbd662c016d","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Asymptotic-midpoint-uniform-convexity-and-unbounded-diamond-distortion-in-a-reflexive-tree-space-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L99"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThe space $X=J^*$ defined by \\eqref{eq:segment-norm} is infinite\ndimensional, separable, and reflexive, and has no equivalent AUC norm.\nIts given norm satisfies\n\\[\n \\widehat\\delta_X(t)\\ge\\sqrt{1+t^2/12}-1\\qquad(t>0).\n\\]\nFor every integer $k\\ge0$, every embedding of $D_k$ into $X$ has\ndistortion at least $\\sqrt{1+k/12}$."}
